Ho! Hoo!
Welcome to White Forest!{VAR BE01}
In White Forest, people live
in harmony with nature and with Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
Please listen to the voice of the forest.{VAR BE01}
It's saying “Bienvenue!"
Ho! Hoo! Hoo!{VAR BE01}

I do research into the Pokémon
that live in this forest.{VAR BE01}
In theory, you should find {VAR 0101 0000}
living in this forest.{VAR BE01}

Hoo!
That's {VAR 0101 0000}!{VAR BE01}
So it lives in this forest, too!{VAR BE01}

What's more, you caught it today!
Ho hoo!{VAR BE01}
This means there are {VAR 0101 0000}
in White Forest.{VAR BE01}
For you, my skilled Pokémon catcher--
this small trifle. Hoo!{VAR BE01}

Thank you very much for today.
See you again tomorrow!{VAR BE01}
The forest is murmuring, “À très vite!"{VAR BE01}

But--that {VAR 0101 0000} wasn't caught
today, was it? Hoo!{VAR BE01}
What I want to know is whether
{VAR 0101 0000} is still living in the forest.{VAR BE01}
The forest itself wants to know, too!

I have always lived with these Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
Hmm. How would you like to try a
Triple Battle with me?

In order to have a Triple Battle,
you need to have at least three{VAR BE00}
Pokémon able to battle.

There are so many things to consider,
but that is part of the fun of{VAR BE00}
Triple Battles!
